        "title": "Absolutely Blissful !!! ❤",
        "text": "One of the most sacred , Historic protected monument which is absolutely blissful , neat and clean Temple in Kathmandu.\n\nHats off to the maintenance team for maintaining this wonderful temple, \nI went there on 25th August and due to it's overall attraction I was forced to comeback on 2nd September before boarding my flight to Chennai via Delhi.\n\nSituated in the heart of Kathmandu and easily accessible from all parts of the city.\nMust visit for all age groups when you are in Kathmandu.\n\nWhen we sit in silence after doing all the formalities, we will be absolutely peaceful and feeling relaxed.\n\nThe whole atmosphere is full of positive vibrations and Bagmathi river adds to the beauty of this glorious place.\n\nThanks a lot for everything,\nLoving you so much,\nPeacefully yours.\nS M Bega Raaj.\nHappy travelling... 🚗 ❤ 💘 ❤ 🚗...",
